OL,3,AFour women and two men killed in Krakow
OL,4,Ashooting as police say suspect wore
OL,5,A'military-style attire'
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour women and two men have been killed
OL,8,Fin a shooting in Krakow, police say,
OL,9,Fwith about a dozen more injured -
OL,10,Fhere's what we know so far
OL,12,FTwo police officers are among the
OL,13,Finjured - one is in a "critical
OL,14,Fcondition", Interior Minister Marcin
OL,15,FKierwiEDski says
OL,17,FPolice say the suspect - a Polish
OL,18,Fcitizen - was shot by officers and
OL,19,Ftaken to hospital. Meanwhile, a police
OL,20,Fspokesperson says the suspect was
OL,21,F"wearing military-style attire" and
OL,22,F"used military weapons"
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
