OL,3,AFour women and two men killed in Krakow
OL,4,Ashooting as police say suspect wore
OL,5,A'military-style attire'
OL,6,
OL,7,FVideo shows gunshots ringing out in the
OL,8,Fsquare; images show emergency services
OL,9,Fat the scene
OL,11,FIn a social media post, Polish PM
OL,12,FDonald Tusk calls the incident "tragic"
OL,13,Fand says he is being kept updated
